   - `apps/graphics/lvgl/lvgl/src/misc/lv_assert.c` (edited — upstream app tree, outside the contest worktree)
     - Added `#include <stdlib.h>` and `#include <syslog.h>`; handler replaced:
       ```c
       void lv_assert_handler(void)
       {
           /* … stock body is LV_ASSERT_HANDLER, default `while(1);` … silent
            * permanent freeze holding lvgl_ui_lock() … */
           syslog(LOG_ERR, "[lvgl] assertion failed -> abort()\n");
           abort();
           LV_UNREACHABLE();
       }
       ```
   - `packages/ai_agent/include/agent_config.h:325-326` — `AGENT_LVGL_UI_STACK (64*1024)`, `AGENT_LVGL_UI_PRIO 45` (the latter was defined but never applied before this session).
