129	/* AP panic record.  The AP console is an RPMsg UART, so NuttX's own panic
130	 * dump never leaves CPU1 once interrupts are off.  The AP panic notifier
131	 * copies the essentials here and the CP monitor prints them.  It sits at
132	 * SWAP offset 0x100, behind every word listed in the map above.  magic is
133	 * cleared while the record is rewritten and stored last. */
